+++ b/11-v2-specialization/diagrams/specialization-cache-identity.svg
@@ -0,0 +1,223 @@
+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1100" height="620" viewBox="0 0 1100 620" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
+  <title id="title">Half a Translation Unit</title>
+  <desc id="desc">The broken specialization cache key omitted device headers, preserving both stale binaries and stale correctness verdicts; the fixed key hashes header content, and binary markers prove which code ran.</desc>
+
